#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"Redis is reachable and fast, but host evidence shows meaningful eviction "
"pressure. Verify existing consumers, database/prefix isolation and memory "
"budget before adding WordPress object-cache load."
msgstr ""
"Redis on kättesaadav ja kiire, kuid serveritõendid näitavad märkimisväärset "
"väljatõstmise survet. Enne WordPressi objektivahemälu lisamist kontrolli "
"olemasolevaid tarbijaid, andmebaasi/eesliite eraldatust ja mälueelarvet."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Redis is reachable but under eviction/memory pressure; adding a new consumer"
" is intentionally blocked pending ownership review."
msgstr ""
"Redis on kättesaadav, kuid väljatõstmise või mälusurve all; uue tarbija "
"lisamine on teadlikult blokeeritud kuni omandiõiguse ülevaatuseni."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"Redis is reachable, bounded, below the adoption pressure threshold and an "
"empty logical database is available. R1 can reserve the target locally; "
"R2/R3 then require a fresh contract and explicit activation approval."
msgstr ""
"Redis on kättesaadav, piiratud, kasutuselevõtu survekünnisest allpool ja "
"tühi loogiline andmebaas on saadaval. R1 saab sihtkoha kohapeal "
"reserveerida; R2/R3 nõuavad seejärel uut lepingut ja aktiveerimise "
"selgesõnalist heakskiitu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Redis isolation & adoption readiness"
msgstr "Redise eraldatus ja kasutuselevõtu valmisolek"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Redis isolation and headroom look safe. Open details to review the bounded "
"activation contract."
msgstr ""
"Redise eraldatus ja mäluvaru tunduvad ohutud. Ava üksikasjad piiratud "
"aktiveerimislepingu ülevaatamiseks."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"Redis logical database reserved locally. No Redis or filesystem change was "
"made; R3 activation still requires a current contract and explicit approval."
msgstr ""
"Redise loogiline andmebaas reserveeriti kohapeal. Redist ega failisüsteemi "
"ei muudetud; R3 aktiveerimine nõuab endiselt kehtivat lepingut ja "
"selgesõnalist heakskiitu."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"Redis maxmemory is not bounded. YPerf will not prepare WordPress object-"
"cache adoption until a reviewed memory boundary exists."
msgstr ""
"Redise maxmemory pole piiratud. YPerf ei valmista WordPressi objektivahemälu"
" kasutuselevõttu ette enne üle vaadatud mälupiiri olemasolu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Redis memory"
msgstr "Redise mälu"

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid "Redis pressure before object-cache adoption"
msgstr "Redise koormus enne objektivahemälu kasutuselevõttu"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Redis reachable"
msgstr "Redis on kättesaadav"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Redis reservations, object-cache runtime, Nginx/PHP-FPM authority, migration"
