msgid "The current YPerf early runtime must pass before Video Lite can be changed."
msgstr ""
"Praegune YPerfi varajane käituskeskkond peab enne Video Lite’i muutmist "
"testi läbima."

msgid ""
"The current YPerf early runtime must pass before media optimization can be "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Praegune YPerfi varajane käituskeskkond peab enne meedia optimeerimise "
"muutmist testi läbima."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The current YPerf version has clean read-only proof."
msgstr "Praeguse YPerfi versiooni ainult lugemiseks mõeldud tõendid on korras."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The current advanced-cache.php ownership or hash is ambiguous. Artifact "
