"workspace."
msgstr "Valitud Yablonsky AI tekstimudel pole sellele kinnitatud tööruumile saadaval."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected local profile can now be applied inside the YPerf-owned "
"WordPress boundary."
msgstr ""
"Valitud kohaliku profiili saab nüüd rakendada YPerfi hallatava WordPressi "
"piires."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected settings backup is not valid JSON."
msgstr "Valitud seadete varukoopia pole korrektne JSON."

msgid ""
"The setting changes WordPress origin delivery only. Existing external "
"Nginx/Cloudflare HTML cache entries require independent freshness "
"verification; YPerf does not silently purge host caches."
msgstr ""
"See säte muudab ainult WordPressi lähteserveri edastust. Olemasolevad "
"välised Nginxi/Cloudflare’i HTML-vahemälu kirjed vajavad sõltumatut värskuse"
" kontrolli; YPerf ei tühjenda serverivahemälu vaikselt."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The settings backup does not contain any portable YPerf settings."
msgstr "Seadete varukoopia ei sisalda ühtegi teisaldatavat YPerfi seadet."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The settings backup is larger than the supported 256 KB safety limit."
msgstr "Seadete varukoopia ületab toetatud 256 KB turvapiiri."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site is functional, but current host/FPM headroom does not prove a "
"comfortable reserve for admin work during frontend pressure. Origin Budget "
"review should preserve an explicit control-plane reserve."
msgstr ""
"Sait töötab, kuid praegune serveri/FPM-i ressursivaru ei kinnita piisavalt "
"mugavat haldusliidese varu kasutajaliidese koormuse ajal. Lähteserveri "
"eelarve ülevaatus peab säilitama selgesõnalise juhttasandi varu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The site is mapped to a concrete PHP-FPM pool; origin-budget recommendations"
" can now be evidence-based."
msgstr ""
"Sait on seotud konkreetse PHP-FPM-i kogumiga; lähteserveri eelarve "
"soovitused saavad nüüd põhineda tõenditel."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site pool is mapped, but no live worker RSS sample is available. Do not "
"derive an Origin Budget from configuration alone."
msgstr ""
"Saidi kogum on kaardistatud, kuid elusa tööprotsessi RSS-mõõtmist pole "
"saadaval. Ära tuleta lähteserveri eelarvet üksnes konfiguratsioonist."

msgid "The sitemap diagnostic stayed inside its bounded execution budget."
msgstr "Saidikaardi diagnostika jäi piiratud täitmiseelarve sisse."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The stability metric is local same-origin cache evidence, not a Google "
"PageSpeed score. Use repeated PageSpeed runs later as an external field "
"check after YPerf has proved deterministic cache execution."
msgstr ""
"Stabiilsuse mõõdik on kohalik sama päritoluga vahemälutõend, mitte Google "
"PageSpeedi hinne. Kasuta hiljem korduvaid PageSpeedi kontrolle välise "
"praktilise võrdlusena, kui YPerf on deterministliku vahemälu toimimise "
"kinnitanud."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The staged object-cache drop-in failed its read-back hash check."
msgstr ""
"Ettevalmistatud objektivahemälu asendusfail ei läbinud tagasilugemise "
"räsikontrolli."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The stored Page Cache artifact hash does not match the live file. Refresh is"
" blocked."
msgstr ""
"Salvestatud lehevahemälu faili räsi ei vasta tegelikule failile. "
"Värskendamine on blokeeritud."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The zone is exclusive to this server block. YPerf can operate prewarm now "
"while host writes remain locked."
msgstr ""
"Tsoon kuulub ainult sellele serveriplokile. YPerf saab juba teha "
"eelsoojendust, samal ajal kui serverisse kirjutamine jääb lukustatuks."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Theme contrast, accessibility styling and third-party scripts such as chat "
"widgets remain outside this write boundary. YPerf may diagnose those costs "
"later, but this campaign does not rewrite external code just to improve a "
"benchmark score."
msgstr ""
"Kujunduse kontrastsus, ligipääsetavuse stiilid ja kolmandate osapoolte "
"skriptid, näiteks vestlusvidinad, jäävad sellest kirjutuspiirist välja. "
"YPerf võib nende kulu hiljem diagnoosida, kuid see kampaania ei kirjuta "
"välist koodi ümber ainult võrdlustesti tulemuse parandamiseks."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Think of it as PageSpeed Insights with access under the hood."
msgstr "Mõtle sellest kui PageSpeed Insightsist, millel on juurdepääs sisemusse."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "This YPerf capability is operated from its dedicated bounded workflow."
msgstr "Seda YPerfi võimalust hallatakse eraldi piiratud töövoos."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This completed migration remains visible as history. Future YPerf updates do"
" not ask you to migrate the same provider again."
msgstr ""
"See lõpetatud migreerimine jääb ajalukku nähtavaks. Tulevased YPerfi "
"uuendused ei palu sama teenusepakkujat uuesti migreerida."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "This file is not a supported Yablonsky Performance settings backup."
msgstr "See fail pole toetatud Yablonsky Performance’i seadete varukoopia."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This gate turns intermittent admin incidents into explicit release/tuning "
"evidence. It never raises PHP memory, changes FPM or alters the WordPress "
"upgrader automatically."
msgstr ""
"See kontroll muudab juhuslikud haldusliidese intsidendid selgesõnalisteks "
"väljalaske- ja häälestustõenditeks. See ei suurenda automaatselt PHP-mälu, "
"muuda FPM-i ega WordPressi uuendajat."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This indicator tracks site configuration and evidence — not YPerf "
"development progress."
msgstr ""
"See indikaator jälgib saidi seadistust ja tõendeid, mitte YPerfi arenduse "
"edenemist."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a PHP runtime capability, not something YPerf should imitate in "
"WordPress."
msgstr ""
"See on PHP käituskeskkonna võimalus, mitte miski, mida YPerf peaks "
"WordPressis jäljendama."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a core YPerf advantage: first-hit work is treated separately from "
"repeat-hit cache."
msgstr ""
"See on YPerfi keskne eelis: esmapäringu tööd käsitletakse korduvate HIT-"
"vastuste vahemälust eraldi."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a local low-risk optimization layer; it is intentionally separate "
"from cache and server adoption."
msgstr ""
"See on kohalik väikese riskiga optimeerimiskiht; see on teadlikult eraldatud"
" vahemälu ja serveri kasutuselevõtust."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is separate from Site Readiness. It tracks whether the detected legacy "
"provider can be retired without losing an active responsibility."
msgstr ""
"See on saidi valmisolekust eraldi. See jälgib, kas tuvastatud vana "
"teenusepakkuja saab kõrvaldada ilma aktiivset ülesannet kaotamata."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the answer to “what is actually working?”. Detection alone never "
"gets a green ACTIVE state."
msgstr ""
"See vastab küsimusele „mis tegelikult töötab?”. Ainuüksi tuvastamine ei anna"
" kunagi rohelist AKTIIVNE-olekut."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the first explicit local write boundary: YPerf may create only its "
"own wp-content/object-cache.php and namespaced Redis health/cache keys in "
"the reserved logical database."
msgstr ""
"See on esimene selgesõnaline kohalik kirjutuspiir: YPerf võib luua ainult "
"enda wp-content/object-cache.php faili ja nimeruumiga Redise "
"tervise-/vahemäluvõtmed reserveeritud loogilises andmebaasis."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid "This provider responsibility is not supported by the guided resolver."
msgstr "Juhendatud lahendaja ei toeta seda teenusepakkuja ülesannet."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This refresh is read-only: it rechecks the environment, runs Runtime "
"Acceptance and rebuilds the performance benchmark. It does not enable cache,"
" alter providers or change host configuration."
msgstr ""
"See värskendus on ainult lugemiseks: kontrollib keskkonda uuesti, käivitab "
"käituskeskkonna vastuvõtukontrolli ja koostab jõudluse võrdluskatse uuesti. "
"See ei luba vahemälu, muuda teenusepakkujaid ega serverikonfiguratsiooni."

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"This site has enough published content for publishing workflow automation to"
" become relevant. A future Yablonsky Publisher integration can use YPerf "
"performance evidence without turning the cache dashboard into an advertising"
" surface."
msgstr ""
"Saidil on piisavalt avaldatud sisu, et avaldamise töövoo automatiseerimine "
"oleks asjakohane. Tulevane Yablonsky Publisheri integratsioon saab kasutada "
"YPerfi jõudlustõendeid, muutmata vahemälu töölauda reklaamipinnaks."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This site-level view tracks optional Redis/native-host execution lanes and "
"provider-retirement evidence. It is informative and does not make optional "
"host features a market-release requirement."
msgstr ""
"See saiditaseme vaade jälgib valikulisi Redise/natiivse serveri täitmisviise"
" ja teenusepakkuja kõrvaldamise tõendeid. See on informatiivne ega muuda "
"valikulisi serverifunktsioone turuväljalaske nõudeks."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This snapshot proves only part of the native stack. Run the Host Inspector "
"bundled with the current YPerf release to capture site-specific Nginx "
"ownership, Redis isolation/headroom and exact PHP-FPM worker-memory "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"See hetktõmmis kinnitab ainult osa natiivsest pinust. Käivita praeguse "
"YPerfi väljalaskega kaasas olev Host Inspector, et koguda saidipõhised "
"Nginxi omandiõiguse, Redise eraldatuse ja mäluvaru ning täpsed PHP-FPM-i "
"tööprotsesside mälutõendid."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This tile is evidence only. YPerf does not claim ownership of an external "
"runtime layer."
msgstr "See kaart on ainult tõend. YPerf ei väida, et haldab välist käituskihti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Three frontend samples per route plus isolated Redis/Memcached localhost "
